{"name":"Reticence","hex":"#d9cdc3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"reticence","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Avoidance of saying or reluctance to say too much; discretion, tight-lippedness;  an instance of acting in this manner.","A silent and reserved nature."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To deliberately not listen or pay attention to; to disregard, to ignore."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/reticence"}],"entries":[{"title":"Modesty","blocks":[{"text":"Modesty, sometimes known as demureness, is a mode of dress and deportment which intends to avoid the encouraging of sexual attraction in others. The word modesty comes from the Latin word modestus which means 'keeping within measure'."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/CaliforniaBeachc1905.jpg/330px-CaliforniaBeachc1905.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Modesty","wikidata":"Q11199149"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/1868-skirt-lengths-girl-ages-Harpers-Bazar.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/1868-skirt-lengths-girl-ages-Harpers-Bazar.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"1868 diagram from Harper's Bazaar showing proper girls' skirt lengths increasing as they grow up","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A1868-skirt-lengths-girl-ages-Harpers-Bazar.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Orthodox_pilgrim.jpg/500px-Orthodox_pilgrim.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Orthodox_pilgrim.jpg/1280px-Orthodox_pilgrim.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.